#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:2
msgid "5. Imperative Virtualized Lists & Grouping"
msgstr "5. 命令式虚拟化列表与分组协议"

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:4
msgid ""
"In declarative mode, ``xtk_list`` accepts an ``item(ui, env, index)`` "
"callback. In imperative mode (and across language bindings), "
"virtualization is driven by a clean, control-neutral event contract: "
"**the host tells you which visible index window is on screen via** "
"``XTK_EVENT_REALIZE`` **, and you populate that slice inside an** "
"``XtkTxn``."
msgstr ""
"声明式模式下 ``xtk_list`` 接收 ``item(ui, env, index)`` 回调；而在命令式模式（以及各语言绑定）中，"
"虚拟化由一套与具体控件解耦的事件契约驱动：**宿主通过** ``XTK_EVENT_REALIZE`` **告知当前屏幕可见的下标窗口，"
"应用在** ``XtkTxn`` **事务内填充这一小段可见项** 。"

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:11
msgid "How ``XTK_EVENT_REALIZE`` Works"
msgstr "``XTK_EVENT_REALIZE`` 工作机制"

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:13
msgid ""
"When you create a ``ListView``, ``ListBox``, ``GridView``, or "
"``ItemsRepeater`` with ``.nitem = 100000``, zero row controls exist "
"initially. Whenever layout measures the viewport or the user scrolls into"
" a new row range, the host fires ``XTK_EVENT_REALIZE`` on the list "
"control with ``event->payload.kind == XTK_EVENT_PAYLOAD_WINDOW``:"
msgstr ""
"以 ``.nitem = 100000`` 创建 ``ListView`` 、 ``ListBox`` 、 ``GridView`` 或 ``ItemsRepeater`` 时，"
"初始状态下包含零个行子控件。每当布局引擎完成视口测量或用户滚动进入新的行区间时，宿主都会在列表控件上触发 "
"``XTK_EVENT_REALIZE`` （ ``event->payload.kind == XTK_EVENT_PAYLOAD_WINDOW`` ）："

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:19
msgid "``event->payload.u.window.first`` — First visible row index to realize."
msgstr "``event->payload.u.window.first`` —— 需要实例化的首个可见行下标。"

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:20
msgid ""
"``event->payload.u.window.last`` — Last visible row index (inclusive) to "
"realize."
msgstr "``event->payload.u.window.last`` —— 需要实例化的最后一个可见行下标（闭区间）。"

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:22
msgid ""
"``event->payload.u.window.lanes`` — Column count per row (``1`` for "
"vertical lists, ``>= 1`` for multi-column ``GridView``)."
msgstr "``event->payload.u.window.lanes`` —— 每行包含的列槽数（纵向列表为 ``1`` ，多列 ``GridView`` 为 ``>= 1`` ）。"

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:25
msgid ""
"Inside your ``XTK_EVENT_REALIZE`` callback, open one ``XtkTxn`` and "
"perform four steps:"
msgstr "在 ``XTK_EVENT_REALIZE`` 回调内开启一个 ``XtkTxn`` 事务并依次完成四步："

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Drop** previously realized ``XtkCtrl`` items whose indices fell outside"
" ``[first, last]``."
msgstr "**销毁（Drop）** 下标已滑出 ``[first, last]`` 区间外的旧 ``XtkCtrl`` 行控件。"

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Keep** items that remain inside the overlapping window so scrolling "
"reuses existing controls in place."
msgstr "**保留（Keep）** 仍处于重叠可见窗口内的现有行控件，使滚动过程原地复用已有实例。"

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Create** ``XTK_CTRL_LISTITEM`` children for newly visible indices "
"(inserting before the first kept item when scrolling upward, or appending"
" at the end when scrolling downward) and populate their interior "
"controls."
msgstr ""
"**创建（Create）** 新进入视口的 ``XTK_CTRL_LISTITEM`` 子节点（向上滚动时插入到首个保留行之前，"
"向下滚动时追加到末尾），并在其内部填充具体内容控件。"

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Publish** ``XTK_PROP_REALIZED_FIRST = first`` on the list control and "
"commit the transaction."
msgstr "**发布（Publish）** 列表控件的 ``XTK_PROP_REALIZED_FIRST = first`` 属性并提交事务。"

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:39
msgid "Complete 100,000-Row Imperative ``ListView`` Example"
msgstr "完整的 10 万行命令式 ``ListView`` 示例"

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:41
msgid ""
"Remember to register ``&flux_ctrl_list``, ``&flux_ctrl_container``, and "
"``&flux_ctrl_text`` (or call ``flux_controls_all()``):"
msgstr "记得在启动时注册 ``&flux_ctrl_list`` 、 ``&flux_ctrl_container`` 与 ``&flux_ctrl_text`` （或调用 ``flux_controls_all()`` ）："

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:140
msgid ""
"Attach ``on_list_realize`` when creating the list inside your initial "
"build transaction:"
msgstr "在初始构建事务中创建列表时挂载 ``on_list_realize`` 回调："

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:161
msgid "Grouped Lists & Sticky Headers (0.3.3)"
msgstr "分组列表与吸顶组标题（0.3.3）"

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:163
msgid ""
"To group a ``ListView`` or ``GridView`` into sections with inline sticky "
"headers:"
msgstr "为 ``ListView`` 或 ``GridView`` 启用分段与内联吸顶组标题只需两步："

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:165
msgid ""
"Write the ``int32_t`` array of group sizes to ``XTK_PROP_GROUPS`` as an "
"``XTK_VALUE_BYTES`` slice during list creation:"
msgstr "创建列表时将各组元素个数的 ``int32_t`` 数组作为 ``XTK_VALUE_BYTES`` 字节切片写入 ``XTK_PROP_GROUPS`` ："

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:181
msgid ""
"In your ``XTK_EVENT_REALIZE`` handler, flat row indices interleave group "
"headers and items. Call ``XtkListRow at = xtk_list_row(kGroupSizes, 3, "
"row)`` from ``<xtk/xtk.h>``:"
msgstr ""
"在 ``XTK_EVENT_REALIZE`` 回调中，扁平行号由组标题与数据项交错组成。调用 ``<xtk/xtk.h>`` 中的 "
"``XtkListRow at = xtk_list_row(kGroupSizes, 3, row)`` 进行映射："

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:185
msgid ""
"When ``at.item < 0``, ``row`` is the header for ``at.group``—instantiate "
"``XTK_CTRL_GROUPHEADER`` via ``xtk_txn_create``."
msgstr "当 ``at.item < 0`` 时，该 ``row`` 是第 ``at.group`` 组的标题行——通过 ``xtk_txn_create`` 创建 ``XTK_CTRL_GROUPHEADER`` 。"

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:187
msgid ""
"When ``at.item >= 0``, ``row`` is logical item ``at.item`` inside "
"``at.group``—instantiate ``XTK_CTRL_LISTITEM``."
msgstr "当 ``at.item >= 0`` 时，该 ``row`` 是第 ``at.group`` 组内的逻辑数据项 ``at.item`` ——创建 ``XTK_CTRL_LISTITEM`` 。"

#: ../../source/imperative/virtualization.rst:189
msgid ""
"When ``window.first`` lands inside a group (``at.item >= 0``), also keep "
"that group's header row realized right before ``first`` so the host can "
"pin it as the sticky header at the top of the viewport. See "
"``groups_realize`` in ``fluxent/examples/gallery_imp/app.c`` for a drop-"
"in reference implementation."
msgstr ""
"当 ``window.first`` 落在某个分组内部（ ``at.item >= 0`` ）时，同时将该组对应的标题行实例化在 ``first`` 之前，"
"以便宿主将其吸顶固定在视口顶端。可直接参考 ``fluxent/examples/gallery_imp/app.c`` 中的 ``groups_realize`` 完整实现。"
